WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.785
u.s./china relations.

00:00:01.785 --> 00:00:02.419
The world will be watching in

00:00:02.552 --> 00:00:04.321
the hours and days ahead.

00:00:04.454 --> 00:00:06.690
Let's get straight to CNN's Oren

00:00:06.823 --> 00:00:08.291
Liebermann at the Pentagon.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.793
Oren, what more are you

00:00:09.793 --> 00:00:09.960
learning?

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:11.294
I understand you were listening

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.230
to officials explain how all of

00:00:13.363 --> 00:00:14.030
this went down.

00:00:14.164 --> 00:00:17.968
What can you tell us?

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.604
&gt;&gt; It started on Wednesday when

00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:22.205
president Joe Biden gave the

00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:26.109
authorization to shoot down the

00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:41.258
Chinese balloo

00:00:45.829 --> 00:00:47.831
N as soon as

00:00:47.831 --> 00:00:47.964
possible.

00:00:48.098 --> 00:00:49.065
There were tankers and others to

00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:50.200
shoot this down.

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:56.807
It was an f-22 that fired an a 9

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.408
side winder.

00:00:58.542 --> 00:01:01.011
The aircraft itself was shooting

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:01.344
itself.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:03.380
The balloon between 60 and

00:01:03.513 --> 00:01:05.348
65,000 feet so at incredibly

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.350
high altitude.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:09.119
The one shot took the balloon

00:01:09.252 --> 00:01:10.954
down and crashed into waters

00:01:11.087 --> 00:01:11.254
below.

00:01:11.388 --> 00:01:13.123
We saw some of the videos coming

00:01:13.256 --> 00:01:14.257
out from eye witnesses.

00:01:14.391 --> 00:01:16.092
This was an operation which we

00:01:16.226 --> 00:01:18.895
saw building up to it.

00:01:19.029 --> 00:01:21.031
As well as the ground stop on

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:23.967
airports along the post there.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.235
Working in coordination with the

00:01:25.368 --> 00:01:26.970
FAA and be other agencies to

00:01:27.103 --> 00:01:28.104
make this happen.

00:01:28.238 --> 00:01:30.841
The culmination of the Chinese

00:01:30.974 --> 00:01:31.942
balloon that was a spy balloon

00:01:32.075 --> 00:01:33.877
that tracked across the country

00:01:33.877 --> 00:01:35.045
until it was shot down.

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:36.880
Worth noting according to a

00:01:37.013 --> 00:01:38.949
senior defense official, they

00:01:39.082 --> 00:01:40.784
effectively mitigated the

00:01:40.917 --> 00:01:42.886
ability of the balloon to gather

00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:43.887
Intel.

00:01:43.887 --> 00:01:44.921
Crucially, that same official

00:01:45.055 --> 00:01:47.057
said the U.S. Was able to do the

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.625
reverse, to gather Intel about

00:01:48.758 --> 00:01:51.027
the balloon itself, the

00:01:51.161 --> 00:01:52.596
technologies it has,

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:54.464
surveillance capabilities, what

00:01:54.598 --> 00:01:56.299
Intel it can pick up as it made

00:01:56.433 --> 00:01:58.001
its way across the U.S.

00:01:58.134 --> 00:02:00.170
The U.S. Was gathering Intel on

00:02:00.303 --> 00:02:01.538
the balloon itself.

00:02:01.905 --> 00:02:03.073
They couldn't go into all that

00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:04.140
much more detail.

00:02:04.274 --> 00:02:05.909
&gt;&gt; Oren, one of the big

00:02:05.909 --> 00:02:06.977
questions at this hour is can

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:08.478
they scoop it up out of the

00:02:08.612 --> 00:02:10.247
water and learn more about this

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.581
balloon by retrieving it?

00:02:11.915 --> 00:02:13.917
What more do we know about the

00:02:13.917 --> 00:02:14.484
recovery efforts that are

00:02:14.618 --> 00:02:15.185
underway right now?

00:02:15.318 --> 00:02:15.919
&gt;&gt; Absolutely.

00:02:16.052 --> 00:02:18.321
As you pointed out, those

00:02:18.455 --> 00:02:20.123
efforts are already underway.

00:02:20.257 --> 00:02:21.925
Navy and coast guard assets were

00:02:21.925 --> 00:02:22.792
standing by already knowing that

00:02:22.926 --> 00:02:24.261
this was the outcome the

00:02:24.394 --> 00:02:25.595
military was going for.

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.698
The pay load, the object hanging

00:02:28.832 --> 00:02:30.467
below that balloon about three

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.935
school buses long we have

00:02:31.968 --> 00:02:33.436
reported crashed in about 47

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.939
feet of water the senior defense

00:02:35.972 --> 00:02:36.606
official said.

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:38.408
Pretty shallow making it fairly

00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:39.276
easy to recover.

00:02:39.409 --> 00:02:41.077
In terms of what shape it's in,

00:02:41.211 --> 00:02:42.846
what did the impact with the

00:02:42.979 --> 00:02:44.247
water do to it, that's a

00:02:44.381 --> 00:02:45.949
question we're waiting to find

00:02:45.949 --> 00:02:46.016
out.

00:02:46.149 --> 00:02:47.951
That will go a long way into

00:02:47.951 --> 00:02:54.257
determining what we can do to

00:02:54.391 --> 00:02:54.624
find out.

00:02:54.758 --> 00:02:56.293
In terms of what more Intel can

00:02:56.426 --> 00:02:58.795
be gathered about the Chinese

00:02:58.929 --> 00:03:00.096
technology on board of this.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.165
Also worth noting the officials

00:03:02.299 --> 00:03:04.334
we spoke with pointed out the

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:06.036
explanation, the weather balloon

00:03:06.169 --> 00:03:07.971
and flatly rejecting it saying

00:03:08.104 --> 00:03:09.105
it had no credibility.

00:03:09.239 --> 00:03:10.774
&gt;&gt; Oren Liebermann, thank you

00:03:10.907 --> 00:03:11.975
very much.

00:03:11.975 --> 00:03:12.976
Let's get straight to the white

00:03:13.109 --> 00:03:14.077
house.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.178
CNN's arlitt Saenz.

00:03:15.312 --> 00:03:16.613
We heard from the president a

00:03:16.746 --> 00:03:17.447
short while ago.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.182
He was very emphatic that he

00:03:19.316 --> 00:03:21.985
ordered this balloon to be shot

00:03:21.985 --> 00:03:22.118
down.

00:03:22.252 --> 00:03:23.553
What more can you tell us?

00:03:23.987 --> 00:03:25.989
&gt;&gt; Reporter: He was, Jim.

00:03:25.989 --> 00:03:27.223
President Biden was on air force

00:03:27.357 --> 00:03:29.993
one traveling from Syracuse, new

00:03:30.026 --> 00:03:32.295
York, to Hagerstown, Maryland,

00:03:32.429 --> 00:03:34.798
when the military undertook this

00:03:34.931 --> 00:03:35.165
operation.

00:03:35.298 --> 00:03:36.366
President Biden spoke to

00:03:36.499 --> 00:03:37.600
reporters just in the last hour

00:03:38.001 --> 00:03:39.402
where he tried to clearly lay

00:03:39.536 --> 00:03:43.473
out the time line of when he

00:03:43.606 --> 00:03:44.708
gave that order saying he told

00:03:44.841 --> 00:03:46.776
his military officials he wanted

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.278
to shoot down that plane as soon

00:03:48.411 --> 00:03:49.112
as possible.

00:03:49.245 --> 00:03:50.413
Take a listen to what the

00:03:50.547 --> 00:03:52.816
president had to say.

00:03:52.949 --> 00:03:53.650
&gt;&gt; On Wednesday when I was

00:03:54.017 --> 00:03:56.019
briefed on the balloon I ordered

00:03:56.019 --> 00:03:58.455
the Pentagon to shoot it down on

00:03:58.588 --> 00:04:00.090
Wednesday as soon as possible.

00:04:00.223 --> 00:04:02.025
They decided without doing

00:04:02.025 --> 00:04:05.228
damage to anyone on the

00:04:05.362 --> 00:04:06.963
ground -- they decided the best

00:04:07.097 --> 00:04:10.033
time to do that was when it got

00:04:10.066 --> 00:04:12.702
over water within a 12-mile

00:04:12.836 --> 00:04:13.069
limit.

00:04:13.203 --> 00:04:14.504
They successfully took it down

00:04:14.637 --> 00:04:17.574
and I want to compliment our

00:04:17.707 --> 00:04:18.708
aviators that did it.

00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:20.143
We'll have more to report on

00:04:20.276 --> 00:04:21.378
this a little later.

00:04:21.511 --> 00:04:22.045
Thank you.

00:04:22.045 --> 00:04:24.180
&gt;&gt; Mr. President, what do you

00:04:24.314 --> 00:04:24.814
say about --

00:04:24.948 --> 00:04:27.050
&gt;&gt; What's your message to China?

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:28.118
&gt;&gt; You're saying your

00:04:28.251 --> 00:04:28.885
recommendation was from --

00:04:29.019 --> 00:04:30.387
&gt;&gt; I told them to shoot it down.

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.388
&gt;&gt; On Wednesday?

00:04:31.521 --> 00:04:32.122
&gt;&gt; On Wednesday.

00:04:32.255 --> 00:04:33.390
&gt;&gt; But the recommendation --

00:04:33.523 --> 00:04:35.291
&gt;&gt; They said to me let's wait

00:04:35.425 --> 00:04:37.427
until the safest place to do it.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.828
&gt;&gt; So the president quite

00:04:38.962 --> 00:04:40.063
emphatic there that he did give

00:04:40.096 --> 00:04:40.764
that order on Wednesday.

00:04:40.897 --> 00:04:42.732
Of course, he had been facing a

00:04:42.866 --> 00:04:44.934
slew of criticism from

00:04:45.068 --> 00:04:46.770
Republicans up on capitol hill

00:04:46.903 --> 00:04:48.071
who had slammed the president

00:04:48.071 --> 00:04:50.073
for not taking action sooner.

00:04:50.073 --> 00:04:51.341
We've heard from Republicans

00:04:51.474 --> 00:04:53.309
today praising the decision to

00:04:53.443 --> 00:04:55.412
shoot down that balloon but they

00:04:55.545 --> 00:04:57.680
did say they wished he had taken

00:04:58.081 --> 00:04:59.182
these steps much sooner.

00:04:59.315 --> 00:05:00.917
There have also been Democrats

00:05:01.051 --> 00:05:03.353
who have major questions for the

00:05:03.486 --> 00:05:04.687
white house about how exactly

00:05:04.821 --> 00:05:06.289
this has all played out.

00:05:06.423 --> 00:05:08.091
Senator mark Warner, the head of

00:05:08.091 --> 00:05:10.226
the senate intelligence

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.095
committee, said China itself

00:05:12.095 --> 00:05:13.530
wouldn't have allowed a balloon

00:05:13.663 --> 00:05:21.104
like this to fly over the

00:05:21.237 --> 00:05:23.139
heartland.

00:05:23.273 --> 00:05:24.107
John tester wants to hold

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:26.109
hearings related to this matter.

00:05:26.142 --> 00:05:28.511
Certainly, the president's faced

00:05:28.645 --> 00:05:30.914
a lot of political pressure.

00:05:31.047 --> 00:05:31.748
He was asked what kind of

00:05:32.115 --> 00:05:34.484
message this sends to China.

00:05:34.617 --> 00:05:35.452
He did not answer that.

00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:37.320
This serves as a major tension

00:05:37.454 --> 00:05:39.189
point in that relationship with

00:05:39.322 --> 00:05:39.522
China.

00:05:39.656 --> 00:05:40.857
&gt;&gt; I think the United States has

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:42.892
sent that message.

00:05:43.026 --> 00:05:44.861
Arlitt Saenz with me on the

00:05:44.994 --> 00:05:45.161
phone.

00:05:45.295 --> 00:05:47.097
With me is Jim sciutto.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.331
Jim, to that point.

00:05:48.465 --> 00:05:51.234
I mean, I guess we're reaching a

00:05:51.367 --> 00:05:53.203
new I guess moment in the

00:05:53.336 --> 00:05:54.604
relationship, tense relationship

00:05:54.737 --> 00:05:56.272
between the United States and

00:05:56.406 --> 00:05:59.008
China and president Biden making

00:05:59.142 --> 00:06:00.376
it very clear on Wednesday he

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:02.145
wanted to shoot this thing down.

00:06:02.178 --> 00:06:04.147
&gt;&gt; It's a critical moment, Jim,

00:06:04.147 --> 00:06:06.149
in the relationship between two

00:06:06.149 --> 00:06:08.485
super powers, which was already

00:06:08.618 --> 00:06:10.153
tense and is now more tense.

00:06:10.153 --> 00:06:12.655
Of course, the first hostile

00:06:12.789 --> 00:06:14.724
act, China floating this highly

00:06:14.858 --> 00:06:16.192
capable surveillance balloon

00:06:16.326 --> 00:06:19.028
over the continental U.S.

00:06:19.162 --> 00:06:20.363
Including overflying several

00:06:20.497 --> 00:06:22.398
sensitive installations and now

00:06:22.532 --> 00:06:24.167
a U.S. President making a

00:06:24.267 --> 00:06:26.436
decision to fire weapons, fire a

00:06:26.569 --> 00:06:28.905
missile from an f-22 fighter jet

00:06:29.038 --> 00:06:30.940
to destroy that surveillance

00:06:31.074 --> 00:06:32.242
balloon, but also critically

00:06:32.375 --> 00:06:35.078
take it down in U.S. Territorial

00:06:35.211 --> 00:06:36.579
waters off the coast of south

00:06:36.713 --> 00:06:37.680
Carolina with ships on the

00:06:37.814 --> 00:06:39.415
surface there, as we're told,

00:06:39.549 --> 00:06:41.584
going to make an attempt, at

00:06:41.718 --> 00:06:44.254
least, to collect what it can

00:06:44.387 --> 00:06:46.189
from here that they can further

00:06:46.189 --> 00:06:47.524
learn exactly what Chinese

00:06:47.657 --> 00:06:48.191
capabilities are.

00:06:48.191 --> 00:06:49.859
I think it's also critical to

00:06:50.193 --> 00:06:53.196
note, Jim, as Oren was saying,

00:06:53.329 --> 00:06:55.265
that the U.S. Was able to block

00:06:55.398 --> 00:06:58.201
the surveillance balloon's

00:06:58.201 --> 00:07:00.203
ability to gather intelligence

00:07:00.236 --> 00:07:01.571
while at the same time turning

00:07:01.704 --> 00:07:03.139
the tables to gather

00:07:03.273 --> 00:07:05.375
intelligence on that balloon's

00:07:05.508 --> 00:07:05.775
capability.

00:07:06.209 --> 00:07:06.376
That's critical.

00:07:06.509 --> 00:07:08.311
Big picture, this is a tense

00:07:08.444 --> 00:07:08.645
moment.

00:07:08.778 --> 00:07:09.212
It was already tense.

00:07:09.345 --> 00:07:11.281
We had a U.S. Air force general

00:07:11.414 --> 00:07:13.516
within the last week or so

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.318
warning his forces under his

00:07:15.451 --> 00:07:16.553
command to be prepared for the

00:07:16.686 --> 00:07:19.088
prospect of war with China in

00:07:19.222 --> 00:07:20.590
the year 2025.

00:07:20.723 --> 00:07:22.225
That's not the consensus

00:07:22.292 --> 00:07:23.693
assessment from the U.S., but

00:07:23.826 --> 00:07:25.094
it's not far off from the

00:07:25.228 --> 00:07:26.996
urgency that U.S. Officials feel

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.731
about the prospect for

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:30.233
escalation with China in the

00:07:30.233 --> 00:07:34.837
coming years, and now you have a

00:07:34.971 --> 00:07:36.673
tangible instance of that with

00:07:36.806 --> 00:07:38.341
missiles fired in anger or in

00:07:38.474 --> 00:07:40.276
response to a Chinese

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:41.144
provocation.

00:07:41.277 --> 00:07:44.247
It's a tense time.

00:07:44.247 --> 00:07:44.981
&gt;&gt; Absolutely.

00:07:45.114 --> 00:07:46.716
We might see more provocations

00:07:46.849 --> 00:07:47.350
to come.

00:07:47.483 --> 00:07:49.185
Jim sciutto, thanks for the

00:07:49.319 --> 00:07:50.386
expertise as always.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:50.920
We appreciate it.

00:07:51.054 --> 00:07:53.389
&gt;&gt;&gt; I want to go to CNN's Tom

00:07:53.523 --> 00:07:54.724
foreman on the spy balloon.

00:07:54.857 --> 00:07:56.426
Watching this all day, Tom.

00:07:56.559 --> 00:07:58.328
Very dramatic conclusion to what

00:07:58.461 --> 00:07:59.829
has been a tense few days over

00:08:00.263 --> 00:08:01.130
the United States with this

00:08:01.264 --> 00:08:02.799
balloon making it across the

00:08:02.932 --> 00:08:03.166
country.

00:08:03.299 --> 00:08:04.901
&gt;&gt; We're actually coming up on

00:08:05.034 --> 00:08:05.868
three full days.

00:08:06.269 --> 00:08:08.638
It's believed it took off from

00:08:08.771 --> 00:08:12.275
China, came up over the aleutian

00:08:12.308 --> 00:08:13.543
islands, Canada, then ended up

00:08:13.676 --> 00:08:14.510
down in here.

00:08:14.644 --> 00:08:17.814
That would be roughly an 8500

00:08:17.947 --> 00:08:19.549
mile trip or 1/3 of the distance

00:08:19.682 --> 00:08:20.783
around the world.

00:08:20.917 --> 00:08:22.385
Let's look at what it came over

00:08:22.518 --> 00:08:23.486
on the way here.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.188
When we had these spottings

00:08:25.321 --> 00:08:27.523
here, it gave us an idea of the

00:08:27.657 --> 00:08:28.291
path it was following through

00:08:28.391 --> 00:08:31.594
the United States here.

00:08:31.728 --> 00:08:32.295
These reports maybe it was

00:08:32.395 --> 00:08:33.363
guided to some degree, but this

00:08:33.496 --> 00:08:35.398
matches up pretty well with what

00:08:35.531 --> 00:08:37.500
the jet stream would do with any

00:08:37.634 --> 00:08:38.334
balloon out there.

00:08:38.468 --> 00:08:39.869
What did it pass over?

00:08:40.303 --> 00:08:42.939
Close to a dozen nuclear

00:08:43.072 --> 00:08:44.307
facilities, missile facilities.

00:08:44.307 --> 00:08:45.541
Five or six large military

00:08:45.675 --> 00:08:47.377
facilities on the way and some

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.313
fairly big towns.

00:08:50.313 --> 00:08:52.315
It got reasonably close to

00:08:52.315 --> 00:08:53.883
Kansas City, St. Louis,

00:08:54.317 --> 00:08:55.218
Nashville and others before

00:08:55.351 --> 00:08:59.722
coming into its finish at the

00:08:59.856 --> 00:08:59.989
end.

00:09:00.323 --> 00:09:02.325
Oren said something a moment

00:09:02.358 --> 00:09:02.759
ago.

00:09:02.892 --> 00:09:04.694
This is in 47 feet of water.

00:09:04.827 --> 00:09:06.329
We had already looked at the

00:09:06.329 --> 00:09:07.630
ocean shelf out here.

00:09:07.764 --> 00:09:09.198
Up to about 35 miles before you

00:09:09.332 --> 00:09:12.335
go out it can go up to 600, 700

00:09:12.335 --> 00:09:12.402
feet.

00:09:12.535 --> 00:09:14.771
If it's in 47 feet, that is a

00:09:14.904 --> 00:09:16.739
very precise, excellent depth

00:09:16.873 --> 00:09:18.341
for them to recover it in.

00:09:18.408 --> 00:09:20.777
The it also means they know

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.012
precisely where it came down,

00:09:23.146 --> 00:09:24.347
that it didn't get lost in the

00:09:24.347 --> 00:09:25.715
fall and they know where it is.

00:09:25.848 --> 00:09:26.416
Really important.

00:09:26.549 --> 00:09:27.984
The question now is what are

00:09:28.351 --> 00:09:29.052
they going to find?

00:09:29.185 --> 00:09:30.353
One of the questions that

00:09:30.453 --> 00:09:31.821
military analysts will have

00:09:31.954 --> 00:09:33.489
about this is was the

00:09:33.623 --> 00:09:35.124
information that was being

00:09:35.258 --> 00:09:36.726
collected, the stuff they

00:09:36.859 --> 00:09:37.460
